  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abram and Lot Separate",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abram went up from Egypt to the Negev, with his wife and everything he had, and Lot went with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram had become very wealthy in livestock and in silver and gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From the Negev he went from place to place until he came to Bethel, to the place between Bethel and Ai where his tent had been earlier",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and where he had first built an altar. There Abram called on the name of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Lot, who was moving about with Abram, also had flocks and herds and tents.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the land could not support them while they stayed together, for their possessions were so great that they were not able to stay together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And quarreling arose between Abram's herders and Lot's. The Canaanites and Perizzites were also living in the land at that time.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abram said to Lot, \"Let's not have any quarreling between you and me, or between your herders and mine, for we are close relatives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is not the whole land before you? Let's part company. If you go to the left, I'll go to the right; if you go to the right, I'll go to the left.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lot looked around and saw that the whole plain of the Jordan toward Zoar was well watered, like the garden of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", like the land of Egypt. (This was before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "destroyed Sodom and Gomorrah.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Lot chose for himself the whole plain of the Jordan and set out toward the east. The two men parted company:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram lived in the land of Canaan, while Lot lived among the cities of the plain and pitched his tents near Sodom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the people of Sodom were wicked and were sinning greatly against the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Abram after Lot had parted from him, \"Look around from where you are, to the north and south, to the east and west.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the land that you see I will give to you and your offspring",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make your offspring like the dust of the earth, so that if anyone could count the dust, then your offspring could be counted.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go, walk through the length and breadth of the land, for I am giving it to you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abram went to live near the great trees of Mamre at Hebron, where he pitched his tents. There he built an altar to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.13.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
